  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Can somebody brief me What is the difference between ありうる&ありえる？",
      "html": "Can somebody brief me What is the difference between ありうる&amp;ありえる？",
      "credits_raw": "Rahulk",
      "content_sha256": "f52dfec19de373d09e99e94cb001102ac9b57d53a1692a9bb801c04c2da1386e",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "ありえる is an incorrect reading of あり得る, which should be pronounced as \"ariuru.\" As such it is not a proper Japanese word.",
      "html": "ありえる is an incorrect reading of あり得る, which should be pronounced as \"ariuru.\" As such it is not a proper Japanese word.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "a3ea921b32e835eb3b35b4b877bc200e5744de5405e20adc250731a69547ef4b",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Forgot to mention that 有り得ない is properly \"arienai.\" Here the comstruction is あり＋得ない, thus there is no inconsistency with ありうる.",
      "html": "Forgot to mention that 有り得ない is properly \"arienai.\" Here the comstruction is あり＋得ない, thus there is no inconsistency with ありうる.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "3b0e5e75c6c2eb26b4de35cf333064839d5a3c5880df4a800a897565dd359b8f",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "so [arieru] is a mis-reading, basically?",
      "html": "so [arieru] is a mis-reading, basically?",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "be628505c7162097a938e04c1d320e0c3d8e048c3765e9d15f8b33f5ca1484c6",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "OK: ariuru, arienai\nNG: arieru, ariunai\n\nbut i often hear people say:\n \"sore he arieru ne\" = yeh, thats possible...",
      "html": "OK: ariuru, arienai<br/>NG: arieru, ariunai<br/><br/>but i often hear people say:<br/> \"sore he arieru ne\" = yeh, thats possible...",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "098f05522a5fc1687c36db6b630ddb00000cb9ae57b7b22f7a117a8843387b52",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "It is a derogation of ありうる and people use that, true, but old Japanese like me dislike (abhor) such derogations of Japanese. But for this data base, you probably want to keep ありえる.",
      "html": "It is a derogation of ありうる and people use that, true, but old Japanese like me dislike (abhor) such derogations of Japanese. But for this data base, you probably want to keep ありえる.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "1ea6efc82d27f6aae341280dea8ffda994ff2ac9731fd7fb591efc82db7dcb82",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Thank you very much for the reply.",
      "html": "Thank you very much for the reply.",
      "credits_raw": "Rahulk",
      "content_sha256": "caf9a02633bcc4719b86ba6d170aa8300fb7e29ffe2394a84f5c232489a4cfbe",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Thanks for your clarification bamboo4. You should add that as a note in [arieru].",
      "html": "Thanks for your clarification bamboo4. You should add that as a note in [arieru].",
      "credits_raw": "zlash",
      "content_sha256": "67ea8b0d14565d18111c314f73168c2897d3f9739eaefd0a87dc337d6619fd2b",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
